{"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"title":"rehydrate(into:policy:)","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE9rehydrate4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence","symbolKind":"method"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Re-hydration that reconciles stored rows into the live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":"s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without dropping unflushed writes or in-progress edits (rule #8)."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rehydrate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Store","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MergePolicy","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"store","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The live store to reconcile."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"policy","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only. Pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemoteAdditive","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" after a container rebuild,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where a row’s absence says nothing about whether it was deleted."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes the store rather than ","type":"text"},{"code":"inout State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on purpose. Re-hydration is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mid-session operation with two ","type":"text"},{"code":"await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s in it (the flush, then the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetches), and any caller holding a state snapshot across those would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overwrite everything dispatched in between. Here the flush and every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetch complete first; only then does one suspension-free step pack a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fresh snapshot, merge, and unpack.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Under the default ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote","isActive":true},{"text":", remote edits and remote","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deletions surface mid-session. An ID is exempt whenever the local side","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still has something to say about it — a drained-but-unflushed write, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"un-drained edit, a pending deletion, or a write whose save failed. Those","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"always win, and that guarantee is not configurable.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pending writes and deletions are flushed to disk ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the merge, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remote-change refresh that fires during the debounce window can’t read a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stale disk row for an entity the user just edited or deleted and resurrect","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it. The flush closes most of the window; the dirty set closes what the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remaining suspension points let through.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One case can’t be inferred — an edit still sitting in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view’s local "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" has never reached the store, so a remote value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can land underneath it. Bindings made with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.binding(_:sending:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dispatch on write and are covered already. Otherwise declare the edit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), which exempts one ID for as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"long as it is being edited, or register a whole collection with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If a fetch fails, the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is left untouched","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the failure is reported via ","type":"text"},{"code":"onFailure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/Persi